VERSION ""


NS_ :

BS_:

BU_: SIMULATOR BRIDGE


BO_ 790 Vehicle_Speed: 8 SIMULATOR
 SG_ Vehicle_Speed : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|250] "km/h" BRIDGE

BO_ 1017 Battery_Status: 8 SIMULATOR
 SG_ State_Of_Charge : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|100] "%" BRIDGE


CM_ "Arduino bench rig (arduino_bench_rig/simulator_node). Defines every identifier the rig sends on purpose: 0x316 and 0x3F9. The rig also sends 0x666, which is left out on purpose so that live capture flags it as an identifier this bus should not carry.";
CM_ BO_ 790 "Sent every 20 ms by the simulator board.";
CM_ BO_ 1017 "Sent every 200 ms by the simulator board.";
